# One line ending for the whole repository, decided here rather than by
# whichever machine happens to clone it. Git's default on Windows rewrites
# line endings on checkout, which turns a one-line change into a diff of the
# whole file — this repo already carried seven CRLF files among LF ones, and
# a ten-line edit to one of them once showed up as three hundred and sixty.
#
# `text=auto` still lets Git detect binaries and leave them alone; the images
# and the PDF under assets/ are covered by that.
* text=auto eol=lf
